      "blockers": [
        "StreamClient still composes transport, legacy fallback, Protocol v1 session setup, retry state, and product callbacks in one application-layer owner.",
        "No current-base module contract proves protocol/session ownership is isolated from transport and UI product-session orchestration end to end."
      ],
      "fail_closed_checklist": [
        "Extract a product-session/session-orchestration owner that owns Protocol v1 session lifecycle, epochs, cleanup, and retry transition admission.",
